    "Video (MP4, MOV/ProRes, AVI, WMV, MPEG, MXF, MKV …), pictures (JPEG, PNG, HEIC, TIFF, PSD, RAW …), sound (MP3, WAV, AIFF, WMA, FLAC …), slides (PDF, PowerPoint, Word, text)": "Видео (MP4, MOV/ProRes, AVI, WMV, MPEG, MXF, MKV …), картинки (JPEG, PNG, HEIC, TIFF, PSD, RAW …), звук (MP3, WAV, AIFF, WMA, FLAC …), слайды (PDF, PowerPoint, Word, текст)",
